{"id":"vod_lz_66401","vodId":"66401","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室第二季","name_cn":"暗杀教室第二季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230712-1/1a3e610109b0e95ac5f8dee2b2496e18.jpg"},"summary":"经过南国小岛上和鹰冈的决斗，3年E班的各位与杀老师（福山润 配音）的关系进一步拉近。虽然暗杀活动仍在继续，然而这似乎已经变成了师生之间互动玩乐的重要环节。以茅野枫（洲崎绫 配音）为代表的学生们又开始策划更加精彩的暗杀陷阱。除此之外，他们帮助比琪老师（伊藤静 配音）追求乌间惟臣（杉田智和 配音），又或者磨刀霍霍与A班的精英们展开荣誉与尊严之战。与此同时，白先生带领堀部系成（绪方惠美 配音）卷土重来，而神秘的死神则将E班推向各位凶险的境地。随着最后期限一天天逼近，杀老师和学生们的关系变得愈加微妙……　　本片根据松井优征的超人气漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-07-12 12:49:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22992_c0af4cb0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22990_4a4b248b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22995_58eb37b2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22994_9e1f4107/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22996_8552c0b2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22997_4062d990/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22998_1fe892f2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22999_1af419a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23000_55588c72/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23004_a8b20aea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23002_462702c1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23001_1bb237fe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23003_b0cc22ef/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/23005_4dacffaf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"ht